.TH FERDIM-GUI 1 "2026-11-24" "ferdim 1.5.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ferdim-gui \- GTK 4 front-end for the FerDim download manager
.SH DESCRIPTION
Desktop application showing the FerDim download queue with per-job controls
and a maximum-power toggle. The add window accepts a URL, optional mirrors,
an optional checksum and a "start immediately" switch; it is modal, Enter
activates the default "Download" button and Escape closes it. A settings
window mirrors the web UI: downloads folder, language, connections and
concurrent jobs, turbo, speed limit, night schedule and per-category
windows, watched folders, clipboard watching, sidecar verification and
advanced retries/timeouts. Icon-only buttons carry accessible names and
labels are keyboard mnemonics, so the window is fully usable with a screen
reader. Talks to the
.BR ferdim (1)
daemon over its local socket and starts it on demand. Requires
python3-gobject.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ferdim (1)
